{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>War Grid Hero</strong> is a turn-based card battle game developed by an independent creator. In the game, players must deploy cards to occupy zones, earning points to defeat their opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features three main modes\u3002</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Online Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in battles against other players. Host a match or search for an online match as a guest. Currently, 1v1 battles and a basic mode are supported.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Guide Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn the game mechanics and familiarize yourself with card characteristics. Complete specific levels to unlock new cards. Levels will be updated with the release of new cards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Practice Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle against AI opponents of varying difficulty to practice card combinations and strategies. You can also enter Free Deployment Mode to configure card arrays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Card Basics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Occupy</strong><br>After deployment, the card will occupy neutral or enemy zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703530/extras/Deploy.jpg?t=1746702468\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Override</strong><br>Deploying on top of a friendly card will override it to reclaim the zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703530/extras/Override1.jpg?t=1746702468\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703530/extras/Override2.jpg?t=1746702468\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Support</strong><br>Increases the points of cards within its influence range after deployment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703530/extras/Support.jpg?t=1746702468\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weaken</strong><br>Reduces the points of cards within its influence range after deployment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703530/extras/Weak.jpg?t=1746702468\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Input Support</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game fully supports single-device input (keyboard, mouse, controller).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703530/extras/en_keyboard.png?t=1746702468\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703530/extras/en_controller.png?t=1746702468\" /></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703530?t=1746702468","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703530/34a58af21bbb67d33bcc4c638a97c7a5c245585e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746702468","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703530/fba911fdcb31fcf8d7acbfb9e9795c00968738e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746702468","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703530/fba911fdcb31fcf8d7acbfb9e9795c00968738e7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746702468","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[